          "details": "The one-query contrast changes if sorting, copying, or expensive predicate work must be added first.",
          "wrongOptionExplanationsByOptionId": {
            "both_linear": "A legal binary search halves the remaining interval.",
            "scan_constant": "Worst-case analysis includes target absent or at the end.",
            "binary_without_invariant": "The statement is true only for a correct half-discard implementation."
