      {
        "id": "alg-greedy-intro-gfs-001",
        "prompt": "A proposed minimum-coin algorithm repeatedly takes the largest denomination not exceeding the remaining amount. For denominations {1,3,4} and target 6, what is the correct diagnostic?",
        "constraints": [
