      {
        "id": "alg-greedy-intro-psc-005",
        "prompt": "A vehicle passes fuel stations in order. Whenever it cannot reach the next station or target, it retroactively refuels at the passed station with the largest available fuel, using a max-heap. Which invariant best justifies the greedy choice?",
        "constraints": [
