              "id": "largest_station_is_nearest",
              "text": "The station with the largest fuel is also the nearest station, so it is always feasible."
            },
            {
              "id": "heap_order_proves_minimum",
              "text": "Because a max-heap returns the largest value in logarithmic time, the number of stops is minimal."
            },
            {
              "id": "refuel_at_every_station",
              "text": "Taking fuel at every station cannot hurt because more fuel always improves reach."
