            "task_b_more_greedy": "More local data is not the same as a safe local choice. Pairwise effects make the consequence of a choice depend on the rest of the set.",
            "sorting_decides_both": "A sort key is useful only if it induces a dominance or exchange property. Task B provides no such field under the stated arbitrary interaction model."
