      {
        "id": "recursion-basics-choose-recursive-state-singleton-terminal-without-empty-flag",
        "prompt": "lastValue(i) returns the final element of the non-empty suffix a[i:] and is called only with 0 <= i < len(a).\nA teammate proposes state (i, reachedEmpty) so recursion can stop on an empty suffix. Which review is correct?",
        "constraints": [
