              "id": "negatives_allowed",
              "text": "Negative values are allowed, so extending or shrinking a window need not change the sum monotonically."
            },
            {
              "id": "array_contiguous",
              "text": "The input is contiguous in memory, so window validity is automatically monotone."
            },
            {
              "id": "target_positive",
              "text": "T is positive, so every useful window sum increases when the right boundary moves."
