              "The canonical scoring contract awards preserved adjacent relations."
            ],
            "difficulty": "standard",
            "interaction": {
              "type": "ordering",
              "elements": [
                {
                  "id": "analyze_push",
                  "text": "A push performs O(1) actual work and increases Φ by 1, storing one unit of potential."
                },
                {
                  "id": "analyze_pop",
                  "text": "A pop performs O(1) actual work and decreases Φ by 1, releasing stored potential to pay for the pop."
                },
                {
                  "id": "bound_amortized_step",
                  "text": "Combine actual work and potential change to bound each processed input by O(1) amortized stack-transition cost."
                },
