          "transferBoundary": "Across unfamiliar contexts, select two pointers for endpoint or read/write relations with justified pointer elimination, and sliding window for contiguous candidates with incrementally maintained validity; choose neither when neither invariant exists."
        },
        "authoringProvenance": {
          "author": "OpenAI GPT-5.6 Pro — candidate authoring; human review required",
          "createdAt": "2026-07-18",
