              "details": "Initialize V indegrees and scan E edges to populate them. Every vertex enters the ready queue at most once, and every directed edge triggers one decrement when its source is processed. This totals O(V + E). The indegree array and queue use O(V) auxiliary space. With an adjacency matrix, neighbor scanning may instead cost O(V²), but the dependency invariant is unchanged."
