              "details": "The guard establishes that the two-link fast update is safe. Both pointers then move according to the algorithm, and only afterward does reference equality constitute convergence evidence. Comparing before movement would label every nonempty input cyclic because slow and fast start equal. Some formulations start pointers at different offsets; those require their own explicit proof and guard."
