                "max_discards_work": "Both child calls execute before max combines their values. Logarithmic depth does not eliminate the n leaves that must inspect all elements.",
                "memo_required": "Each range in this fixed binary partition is reached once, so no overlapping state is recomputed. Memoization would add storage without removing repeated work."
              }
            },
