          {
            "id": "recursion-basics-make-progress-toward-base-case-changing-values-prove-descent",
            "prompt": "reduce(n) calls reduce(n // 2) for n > 1. A trace from n = 10 is 10 -> 5 -> 2 -> 1.\nWhat proves progress?",
            "constraints": [
