                "map_makes_nlogn": "Ordered maps often cost logarithmic time, but hash maps are normally expected constant time; the structure must be named precisely.",
                "nested_means_n2": "Left does not restart, so its total moves remain O(n); only the per-operation state cost changes the bound."
              }
            },
