          {
            "id": "alg-tree-preorder-iterative-push-order",
            "prompt": "An iterative preorder traversal pops a node, emits it, then pushes its non-null children onto a LIFO stack.\nThe required visit order is node, left subtree, right subtree. In which order should the children be pushed?",
            "interaction": {
