          {
            "id": "alg-tree-subtree-copy-full-list-cost",
            "prompt": "On a skewed `n`-node tree, each call returns a newly allocated array containing every value in its subtree by copying the child's entire returned array and appending the current value. Determine worst-case time.",
            "interaction": {
