                "global_then_order": "A global answer and a traversal label are implementation choices, not a complete specification. This approach hides what child calls promise and when null is valid.",
                "leaf_only": "Leaf behavior is one boundary, but internal nodes are the inductive step that must be stated explicitly. Example-based inference can leave different callers assuming incompatible meanings."
              }
            },
