            "id": "alg-tree-contract-one-call-per-node-cost",
            "prompt": "A recursive helper is called exactly once for each non-null node, performs constant local work, and makes calls only to the node's children. Let `n` be the number of nodes and `h` the tree height measured in nodes. Determine its asymptotic time and auxiliary call-stack space.",
            "interaction": {
